# Install

```bash
pip install {{ author_name }}.{{ project_slug }}
# or
uv add {{ author_name }}.{{ project_slug }}
```

Then run the CLI:

```bash
{{ project_slug }} --help
{{ project_slug }} Alice
```

From a git checkout (this repo):

```bash
mise trust && mise install
uv sync --all-groups
uv run {{ project_slug }} --help
```
